# A Federation destroyer captures a crippled Klingon destroyer with the transport order. The destroyer is set to green
# alert (Shift+G) so it fires at nothing but its order's target, selected, and given the order with the transport step:
# the transport chord, then a left click on the Klingon ship. The ship starts on team 2 and ends on team 1, and its race
# changes from klingon to the captor's, federation.
# Run it with --layout layouts/transport.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.5
select Boarder
press Shift+G
expect Prize team = 2
expect Prize race = klingon
transport Prize
wait 5
dump captured
expect Prize team = 1
expect Prize race = federation
